  "releaseNotes": "## New Apps\n* Bump `net_conduit_tcp` from `2.2.2` to `2.3.0`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_tcp/2.2.2...net_conduit_tcp/2.3.0)\n* Bump `net_conduit_websocket` from `2.2.2` to `2.3.0`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_websocket/2.2.2...net_conduit_websocket/2.3.0)\n* Bump `net_conduit_udp` from `2.2.2` to `2.3.0`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_udp/2.2.2...net_conduit_udp/2.3.0)\n* Bump `net_conduit_ipc` from `2.2.2` to `2.3.0`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_ipc/2.2.2...net_conduit_ipc/2.3.0)\n* Bump `net_conduit_quic` from `2.2.2` to `2.3.0`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_quic/2.2.2...net_conduit_quic/2.3.0)\n\n## New Version\n* Bump `net_conduit` from `2.2.3` to `2.3.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit/2.2.3...net_conduit/2.3.1)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Enhance Eagerness Flow documentation and refactor event handling by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/73\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/build.20260506024321.a9daba5...build.20260506094410.c842428\n\n---\n\n## Asset Hashes\n| Asset | Hashes |\n|---|---|\n| **[net_conduit.zip](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/releases/download/build.20260506094410.c842428/net_conduit.zip)** | <details><summary>Click to expand</summary> **MD5:** `cddaa7d60245d86aa062aec69f121986`<br> **SHA-1:** `b5e2dcbe354d7e5e13eddaf03960b18fb4318eaa`<br> **SHA-256:** `6965ae147449e340ca0640b457d3bf36a1e766afd0c0c0362154a7be462cbe16`<br> **SHA-512:** `00d524dcc4a5947786a31f51364f60a191e4b9cac53b64339a755b61bb5e71779699fc533854f4207ad58b8b2368380d3b26bfcb47144e61bc2cd302fae64880`<br> </details> |",
